{
    "title": "Breaking Local News: FlashNews",
    "description": "FlashNews keeps you updated with the latest news all over the world - daily news alerts on latest local events, live weather alerts, and breaking news in politics, crime, and science. Receive personalized news summarised for you in only 60 words.\r\n\r\nAre there any important weather alerts? What about traffic updates? No time to go through long news? Make the most of your commute with FlashNews community.  Follow current events in your neighborhood in the form of news summaries that contain daily headlines and facts to help you stay informed of the current affairs.\r\n\r\nStay in the loop with trending headlines from top news sources: New York Times, CBS News, CNN, Fox News, Washington Times, Wall Street Journal, NBC News, The Reuters, ABC News shared by top journalists from all over the U.S and the world.\r\n\r\nRead the daily breaking news that matters to you including sports news, celebrity news, crime news, business news, community news, tech news, health news, real estate news, science news, finance news, live stock market news and many more.\r\n\r\nJoin America's Quickest Local News App, FlashNews!\r\n\r\nFlashNews features and offerings \u2013\r\nLocal news tailored for you: Never miss a beat in your neighborhood!\r\n\u25cf Get local news about your city including local weather news, breaking local news, local crime news, local traffic updates, etc.\r\n\u25cf Stay updated about state news including but not limited to Texas News, NY news and California News with video news and news summaries\r\n\u25cf Daily best news summarized and aggregated right onto your device\r\n\r\nPersonalized News feed:\r\n\u25cf Discover news that matters to you for free\r\n\u25cf Get personalized daily news, specially curated for your liking\r\n\u25cf Access latest trending news including National News, International News and Global news\r\n\u25cf Our expert news aggregators collect news from all around the globe, recommended to you with the help of AI\r\n\r\nRead News Summary across categories:\r\n\u25cf FlashNews offers 20+ news categories including: local weather news, local breaking news, local crime news, local traffic updates, etc.\r\n\u25cf Latest Crime News - Updates about criminal offense in and around your locality and globally\r\n\u25cf Trending Entertainment News - Trending news covering Hollywood news, Celebrity news and other entertainment shows\r\n\u25cf Sports News - Stay updated with your favorite sports team covering major leagues like MLS, MLB, NBA, NFL, etc.\r\n\u25cf Political News - Stay updated on street politics and elections. Track the latest developments in local, state, national politics and elections from Fox News, Yahoo News, CBS News\r\n\u25cf Stock Market News - Get the latest Stock Market News. In depth Stock Analysis provided by the world's most renowned fund managers\r\n\u25cf Tech News - Dive into the latest news in technology, inspiring entrepreneurship stories from TechCrunch. Hacking news and gadgets from Engadget and trending software news from CNET, Wired and Gizmodo\r\n\u25cf Latest Science and Economics news - Read about the latest research news in the field of Science and Economics from sources such as The Economist, Forbes, The Wire, etc.\r\n\u25cf Food & Recipes - Explore top recipes from Pinterest, Allrecipes, Buzzfeed, and New York Times (NYT) Cooking\r\n\r\nNews from 1000+ Trusted Sources\r\n\u25cf Access trending news liked and shared by top media publishers\r\n\u25cf Find news from 1000+ trusted sources across the World CNN, Texas Tribune, Wall Street Journal, NBC News, The Reuters, The Texas Tribune, Texas Observer Magazine, etc for free\r\n\u25cf Get access to Global News from top national and international newspapers, journalists and best news sources\r\n\r\nStay Informed with Breaking Local:\r\n\u25cf Get daily alerts covering top headlines from US news through news notifications\r\n\u25cf Catch up on all the surrounding news, all in one place\r\n\u25cf Custom notifications to make sure you never miss out on breaking news covering topics of National and International importance\r\n\r\nDownload today to be informed of the latest local news, US news, and trending World news, with FlashNews: Breaking Local News!",
    "descriptionHTML": "FlashNews keeps you updated with the latest news all over the world - daily news alerts on latest local events, live weather alerts, and breaking news in politics, crime, and science. Receive personalized news summarised for you in only 60 words.<br><br>Are there any important weather alerts? What about traffic updates? No time to go through long news? Make the most of your commute with FlashNews community.  Follow current events in your neighborhood in the form of news summaries that contain daily headlines and facts to help you stay informed of the current affairs.<br><br>Stay in the loop with trending headlines from top news sources: New York Times, CBS News, CNN, Fox News, Washington Times, Wall Street Journal, NBC News, The Reuters, ABC News shared by top journalists from all over the U.S and the world.<br><br>Read the daily breaking news that matters to you including sports news, celebrity news, crime news, business news, community news, tech news, health news, real estate news, science news, finance news, live stock market news and many more.<br><br>Join America&#39;s Quickest Local News App, FlashNews!<br><br>FlashNews features and offerings \u2013<br>Local news tailored for you: Never miss a beat in your neighborhood!<br>\u25cf Get local news about your city including local weather news, breaking local news, local crime news, local traffic updates, etc.<br>\u25cf Stay updated about state news including but not limited to Texas News, NY news and California News with video news and news summaries<br>\u25cf Daily best news summarized and aggregated right onto your device<br><br>Personalized News feed:<br>\u25cf Discover news that matters to you for free<br>\u25cf Get personalized daily news, specially curated for your liking<br>\u25cf Access latest trending news including National News, International News and Global news<br>\u25cf Our expert news aggregators collect news from all around the globe, recommended to you with the help of AI<